  plugins/jevido.clock
      Derived from the first-party `omarchy.clock` plugin via
      `omarchy plugin clone`. Panel.qml and Model.js originate there.
      Changes: calendar integration for work and personal events, ISO week
      numbers, configurable label formats and a vertical-bar layout.

  plugins/jevido.media
      Derived from the first-party `omarchy.media` plugin via
      `omarchy plugin clone`. Service.qml and MediaModel.js originate there.

  plugins/jevido.wiki
      Original work. It follows Omarchy's plugin conventions and imports its
      `qs.Ui` and `qs.Commons` modules at runtime, but ships no Omarchy code.

